# Agents skill link registry (Make input)
#
# Human map of all skills + end locations: REGISTRY.md
#
# One target per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# Format: <kind><TAB><path>[<TAB><skills...>][<TAB>hosts=<tag[,tag]>]
#
# kind: vault | code
# path: absolute or ~/... (expanded on each machine)
# skills: space-separated names under ~/.agents/skills/ (omit = kind defaults)
# hosts: optional. Omit = all machines. Tags: personal | work
#        personal = mba / Hermes mastermind; work = mbp14m4
# Missing paths are always skipped.
#
# Sync: make agents-link-sync

# Both machines
vault	~/vaults/personal
code	~/code/solopreneur	grill-me grilling tdd ask-matt pr-description gh-stack

# Personal laptop only (Hermes / kamek)
code	~/code/kamek-ai	grill-me tdd ask-matt find-skills gh-stack	hosts=personal
vault	~/vaults/openclaw/workspace	find-skills skill-creator	hosts=personal
